gate INTENT-002
context CODE_CHANGE
question "Does the proposed change remain inside the recorded scope and hard and soft boundaries?"
evidence scope,boundaries,changed_paths
YES COMPLETE
NO HARD-STOP-SCOPE
UNKNOWN UNPROVEN
NOT_APPLICABLE HARD-STOP-SCOPE
end

terminal COMPLETE COMPLETE "The intent and scope are explicit and unchanged."
terminal HARD-STOP-SCOPE HARD_STOP "The work cannot continue outside its admitted intent or scope."
terminal SOFT-REVIEW SOFT_REVIEW "The Campaign Orchestrator must review the intent or scope."
terminal UNPROVEN UNPROVEN "The intent or scope needs evidence before work continues."

